        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Transferred from India Museum 1879. Slip book 6140: 'Loose silk trousers & also close fitting ones of two kinds / Pyjama / Bhopal / 1867 / No invoice price / Original nos: 39 / green, purple and gold / Worn by all the Royal Family during their Youth, and also by the Nobility'\n1880 Register Entry: [Case 24]  '0649. TROUSERS.  \"Pyjamas,\" green figured silk, purple border, gold and silver tinsel; worn by the nobility during youth; Bhopal. 6140'"@en ;
